      <p class="verse-pinyin">qiān&nbsp;&nbsp;shān&nbsp;&nbsp;niǎo&nbsp;&nbsp;fēi&nbsp;&nbsp;jué</p>
      <p class="verse-line">千&nbsp;山&nbsp;鸟&nbsp;飞&nbsp;绝&nbsp;，</p>
